<title>DUBAI: Saudi Arabia beheads Pakistani for smuggling heroin.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia beheads Pakistani for smuggling heroin.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia on Friday beheaded a Pakistani man for smuggling heroin into the kingdom, the Saudi Interior Ministry said.</p>
<p>A ministry statement carried by the official Saudi Press Agency said the man was executed in Riyadh.</p>
<p>The execution brings to 54 the number of people put to death in Saudi Arabia, which enforces Islamic sharia law by publicly beheading convicted murderers, rapists and drug smugglers.</p>
</text>
